:R-HSA-480985  a            owl:NamedIndividual , obo:GO_0006487 ;
        rdfs:comment        "Automated change 2025-10-23: GO:0018279 replaced by GO:0006487" , "Dolichyl-phosphate-glucose functions as a donor of glucose groups in reactions including three steps of N-glycan precursor biosynthesis. Dolichyl-phosphate-glucose itself is synthesized from UDP-glucose and dolichol phosphate on the cytosolic face of the endoplasmic reticulum membrane, then flipped to the luminal surface of that membrane." ;
